### 1. Missing API Key -> 401 Unauthorized (check x-request-id response header)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders

### 2. Wrong API Key -> 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
x-api-key: wrong-key

### 3. Valid API Key + Custom x-request-id Echoed -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
x-api-key: dev-secret-key
x-request-id: req-d59-003

### 4. ParseAreaPipe lowercase ("bole") -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?area=bolE
x-api-key: dev-secret-key

### 5. ParseAreaPipe uppercase ("BOLE") -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?area=BOLE
x-api-key: dev-secret-key

### 6. ParseAreaPipe invalid ("adama") -> 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?area=adama
x-api-key: dev-secret-key

### 7. @Roles("staff") without role header -> 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/staff-queue
x-api-key: dev-secret-key

### 8. @Roles("staff") with customer role -> 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/staff-queue
x-api-key: dev-secret-key
x-role: customer

### 9. @Roles("staff") with staff role -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/staff-queue
x-api-key: dev-secret-key
x-role: staff

### 10. Create Order -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: dev-secret-key

{
  "restaurant": "Habesha 2000",
  "area": "BOLE",
  "totalSantim": 85000
}

### 11. Verify Newly Created Bole Order Appears -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?area=bole
x-api-key: dev-secret-key

### 12. TimeoutInterceptor (6s service delay hits 5s cutoff) -> 408 Request Timeout
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/slow
x-api-key: dev-secret-key